      "user_id": 56728,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765743738333332
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Sarah. One moment while I pull that up... Okay, I see your order for the Aero-Dynamic Helmet, delivered about 65 days ago. To make sure I understand correctly, is it a technical fault or more of a preference issue?",
